IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-COALESCE-V13.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-SOCKETS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 PORTS-PER-SOCKET    PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 TENANT-LANES        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-COALESCE-V13.
    IF NUM-SOCKETS == 0 OR PORTS-PER-SOCKET == 0 OR TENANT-LANES == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 44800 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-SOCKETS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
